            "text": "The hERG blocker model score is 0.6803638935089111.",
            "transform": "identity",
            "citation_ids": [],
            "observation_id": "obs_3b9246b0fe7d48dbada04f107f1f4772",
            "field_path": "predictions.herg.probability_blocker",
            "source_value": 0.6803638935089111,
            "rendered_value": "0.6803638935089111"
          },
          {
            "claim_id": "clm_6a1e9d3c7b5f2a84e0d6c9b3f7a2e5d1",
            "kind": "recommendation",
            "text": "Confirm the signal with direct hERG patch clamp and concentration-response testing before advancing the lead.",
            "transform": "identity",
            "citation_ids": []
          },
          {
            "claim_id": "clm_9b4e2a7d1c6f8e03a5d9b2c7f1e6a4d8",
            "kind": "recommendation",
            "text": "If hERG activity is confirmed at relevant free-drug exposures, follow with a broader cardiac ion-channel panel, action-potential assay, PK exposure-margin analysis, and appropriate QT/ECG characterization.",
